I'm not ready yet.

285
00:15:59,920 --> 00:16:00,960
I'll go soft again.

286
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:03,400
Up to you.

287
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:09,560
Right.

288
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,520
Let's go have lunch.

289
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:13,200
There's something I want to talk about.

290
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,360
But it's not noon yet.

291
00:16:14,760 --> 00:16:15,760
But I'm hungry.

292
00:16:16,160 --> 00:16:17,200
I'm not hungry.

293
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:18,680
Doesn't matter. Let's go.

294
00:16:18,880 --> 00:16:20,000
- Come on.
- Hey.

295
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,400
What are you waiting for?

296
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,280
What the heck?

297
00:16:22,320 --> 00:16:23,360
I'm hungry.

298
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,600
Mind if I sit here?

299
00:16:30,880 --> 00:16:31,920
Mr. Roch.

300
00:16:36,880 --> 00:16:37,880
Please do.

301
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,800
I didn't expect Mr. Roch to eat here.

302
00:16:43,440 --> 00:16:44,560
Outside of work hours,

303
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:45,800
you can drop the mister.

304
00:16:46,760 --> 00:16:48,000
I like eating with the team.

305
00:16:48,640 --> 00:16:50,280
People tend to speak more honestly

306
00:16:50,320 --> 00:16:51,520
outside of meeting rooms.

307
00:16:58,440 --> 00:17:00,000
Great work today.

308
00:17:01,560 --> 00:17:02,800
You've got a lot more to you

309
00:17:02,800 --> 00:17:03,840
than I expected.

310
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,160
Thank you.

311
00:17:08,520 --> 00:17:09,640
By the way,

312
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,520
Mr. Ken has invited us to his spa

313
00:17:11,680 --> 00:17:13,280
to wrap up the project discussion.

314
00:17:13,480 --> 00:17:15,200
I'd like the two of you to come along.

315
00:17:17,640 --> 00:17:19,360
In what capacity?

316
00:17:19,760 --> 00:17:20,760
To close the deal.

317
00:17:22,960 --> 00:17:24,720
I'd like you to help present the project.

318
00:17:26,000 --> 00:17:27,600
So you'll have your own achievement.

319
00:17:27,600 --> 00:17:28,600
Interested?

320
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:32,280
When you gives me an opportunity like this,

321
00:17:32,280 --> 00:17:33,360
I can't say no.

322
00:17:35,160 --> 00:17:36,840
Then let me help Nont too.

323
00:17:39,200 --> 00:17:40,200
It's settled then.

324
00:17:41,400 --> 00:17:42,600
I'll let you know when

325
00:17:43,240 --> 00:17:44,480
I've scheduled it with Mr. Ken.

326
00:17:46,000 --> 00:17:47,080
Yes, sir.

327
00:17:57,600 --> 00:17:58,840
What's the urgent matter, Boss?

328
00:17:58,920 --> 00:17:59,920
I'm free tonight.

329
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:01,640
Free tonight?

330
00:18:02,560 --> 00:18:03,600
What do you mean?

331
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,600
Oh!

332
00:18:19,760 --> 00:18:22,200
Welcome to a new world.

333
00:18:26,600 --> 00:18:28,080
You can look. Don't be afraid.

334
00:18:28,280 --> 00:18:29,280
No one minds.

335
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:35,800
This way, Boss.

336
00:18:42,080 --> 00:18:43,120
Thank you very much.

337
00:18:49,400 --> 00:18:52,120
Then I'll take...

338
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:57,960
Boss.

339
00:18:58,840 --> 00:19:00,000
The menu is upside-down.

340
00:19:03,560 --> 00:19:05,480
Then I'll order for us.

341
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:10,880
Two whiskeys on the rocks please.

342
00:19:17,840 --> 00:19:18,880
Boss,

343
00:19:19,760 --> 00:19:21,120
how are you doing?

344
00:19:21,600 --> 00:19:22,680
How are you feeling?

345
00:19:23,440 --> 00:19:24,640
I didn't think

346
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:26,360
I'd ever come to a place like this.

347
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,200
But it's okay.

348
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:29,920
Step one, passed.

349
00:19:30,240 --> 00:19:32,440
Now may I ask you something?

350
00:19:33,240 --> 00:19:34,400
As Nont's friend?

351
00:19:35,160 --> 00:19:36,160
Go ahead.

352
00:19:36,280 --> 00:19:37,400
Right now in your head,

353
00:19:38,800 --> 00:19:39,840
what is Nont to you?

354
00:19:40,480 --> 00:19:41,440
A "younger brother,"

355
00:19:42,080 --> 00:19:42,920
a "friend,"

356
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:43,880
or

357
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:45,080
"someone you like"?

358
00:19:55,720 --> 00:19:56,960
He's still "Nont".

359
00:19:57,520 --> 00:19:58,880
You didn't answer the question.

360
00:20:00,360 --> 00:20:01,720
Nont is someone I care about.

361
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:07,280
Okay.

362
00:20:07,760 --> 00:20:08,960
Let's start from there then.

363
00:20:09,640 --> 00:20:11,120
When I had my first partner,

364
00:20:11,680 --> 00:20:13,320
I called him "friend" for three months.

365
00:20:13,800 --> 00:20:14,880
Until he said

366
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:16,400
"if you're still going to call me friend,

367
00:20:16,400 --> 00:20:18,040
then just go be friends."

368
00:20:19,920 --> 00:20:21,760
At that point I rushed home

369
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:23,880
and practiced saying the word "partner"

370
00:20:24,120 --> 00:20:25,280
in front of the mirror.

371
00:20:25,280 --> 00:20:26,280
Could you say it right away?

372
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:27,360
No.

373
00:20:27,400 --> 00:20:28,560
It got stuck in my throat.

374
00:20:29,280 --> 00:20:30,320
I was embarrassed

375
00:20:30,640 --> 00:20:31,760
just saying it to a mirror.

376
00:20:36,520 --> 00:20:37,640
For me, the problem

377
00:20:37,640 --> 00:20:38,800
isn't the word "partner".

378
00:20:39,600 --> 00:20:40,800
The problem is ten years

379
00:20:41,200 --> 00:20:42,680
of calling Nont "younger brother".

380
00:20:44,280 --> 00:20:45,960
The word "partner" and "younger brother"

381
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:47,520
are fighting each other in my head.

382
00:20:48,160 --> 00:20:49,320
So you're afraid that

383
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:51,080
if you change it, you'd have to

384
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:52,520
erase everything before, right?

385
00:20:53,160 --> 00:20:54,120
Yes.

386
00:20:54,160 --> 00:20:56,000
Nont isn't your actual biological brother.

387
00:20:56,200 --> 00:20:57,920
You chose to be his older brother figure,

388
00:20:57,920 --> 00:20:59,040
because you chose to be.

389
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:01,400
You and Nont can choose to love each other

390
00:21:01,880 --> 00:21:03,600
without having to erase a single thing.

391
00:21:10,280 --> 00:21:11,320
Thank you, Sharp,

392
00:21:12,200 --> 00:21:13,200
for talking with me.

393
00:21:13,920 --> 00:21:14,960
My pleasure.

394
00:21:52,880 --> 00:21:55,560
(Kit, fighting!)

395
00:22:01,920 --> 00:22:07,200
(Kit, fighting!)

396
00:22:07,840 --> 00:22:08,640
Nont,

397
00:22:08,640 --> 00:22:09,720
why did you rush home?

398
00:22:09,760 --> 00:22:11,120
Why didn't you wait for me?

399
00:22:12,200 --> 00:22:13,440
There were so many people

400
00:22:13,480 --> 00:22:14,560
waiting to talk to you.

401
00:22:14,560 --> 00:22:15,920
Got tired of waiting so I came home first.

402
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:17,680
See, now I'm going to get docked 500

403
00:22:17,720 --> 00:22:19,280
for not looking after you properly.

404
00:22:19,600 --> 00:22:20,760
Has Mom come home yet?

405
00:22:20,920 --> 00:22:21,960
Not yet. See?

406
00:22:23,120 --> 00:22:24,160
You won't get penalized.

407
00:22:26,000 --> 00:22:27,760
And what's all this? So many stickers.

408
00:22:28,760 --> 00:22:30,480
How many heart stickers is that?

409
00:22:31,040 --> 00:22:32,760
One, two, three. Must be hundreds even.

410
00:22:34,240 --> 00:22:35,240
Let me see.

411
00:22:35,800 --> 00:22:37,160
Oh wow!

412
00:22:37,440 --> 00:22:39,040
They go all the way to the back too!

413
00:22:39,080 --> 00:22:40,720
You reach back and stick them?

414
00:22:40,880 --> 00:22:43,240
This many... I don't think that's it.

415
00:22:43,800 --> 00:22:44,760
You bought them and stuck them

416
00:22:44,760 --> 00:22:45,680
on yourself, didn't you?

417
00:22:45,680 --> 00:22:47,040
Which store did you buy from?

418
00:22:47,480 --> 00:22:48,480
Hmm?

419
00:22:48,880 --> 00:22:50,400
Bought them from in front of school?

420
00:22:50,440 --> 00:22:52,200
Then came and stuck this many on yourself.

421
00:22:52,240 --> 00:22:53,120
Afraid people wouldn't...

422
00:22:53,160 --> 00:22:54,440
There, have it.

423
00:22:54,520 --> 00:22:55,560
Now be quiet.

424
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:32,760
Kit.

425
00:23:33,280 --> 00:23:34,320
Fighting!

426
00:23:34,520 --> 00:23:36,120
Are you making fun of me studying?

427
00:23:36,200 --> 00:23:37,200
Just wait.

428
00:23:57,640 --> 00:23:58,720
The life we've had,

429
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,760
we may not have been able to choose it.

430
00:24:00,800 --> 00:24:02,200
But the life ahead of us,

431
00:24:02,240 --> 00:24:03,720
we can choose to make it happy.

432
00:24:07,960 --> 00:24:09,040
Nont.

433
00:24:09,480 --> 00:24:11,000
Don't ever leave Kit, honey.

434
00:24:12,520 --> 00:24:14,680
If one day Kit loses his footing,

435
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:16,960
you have to be the one to bring him back.

436
00:24:18,520 --> 00:24:19,600
And this home,

437
00:24:19,800 --> 00:24:21,000
I'm leaving it in your care.

438
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:22,960
I promise.

439
00:24:24,400 --> 00:24:25,760
No matter what happens,

440
00:24:27,080 --> 00:24:28,600
I will always be by Kit's side.

441
00:24:45,680 --> 00:24:46,840
Kit.

442
00:24:48,680 --> 00:24:49,720
I promise

443
00:24:52,080 --> 00:24:53,560
I will look after you

444
00:24:55,000 --> 00:24:56,200
and won't go anywhere.

445
00:25:00,720 --> 00:25:02,080
This is my private corner.

446
00:25:03,480 --> 00:25:05,080
When I'm feeling troubled

447
00:25:05,680 --> 00:25:07,240
I like to come and let it all out.

448
00:25:08,520 --> 00:25:09,560
Let it out?

449
00:25:10,240 --> 00:25:12,120
I'm going to train you to say...

450
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:14,160
"I like men."

451
00:25:14,640 --> 00:25:15,680
Try saying it.

452
00:25:15,840 --> 00:25:17,160
If you don't practice saying it,

453
00:25:17,160 --> 00:25:18,680
how will you ever be able to say it?

454
00:25:20,680 --> 00:25:21,760
I like men.

455
00:25:22,560 --> 00:25:23,720
Can you say it louder?

456
00:25:24,640 --> 00:25:25,920
I like men!

457
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:27,840
Next sentence,

458
00:25:28,240 --> 00:25:29,360
"I love Nont."

459
00:25:31,800 --> 00:25:32,840
No need to rush.

460
00:25:33,280 --> 00:25:34,440
Say it when you're ready.

461
00:25:36,560 --> 00:25:37,600
I love Nont.

462
00:25:38,200 --> 00:25:39,920
Fantastic, Boss. That was great.

463
00:25:40,560 --> 00:25:41,640
It sounds terrible.

464
00:25:42,960 --> 00:25:44,360
Just being brave enough to say it,

465
00:25:44,400 --> 00:25:45,840
there's nothing terrible about that.

466
00:25:45,880 --> 00:25:47,240
Then, want to try again?

467
00:25:51,560 --> 00:25:52,760
I love Nont!

468
00:25:53,760 --> 00:25:54,880
I love Nont!

469
00:25:55,640 --> 00:25:56,720
Okay, next one.

470
00:25:57,000 --> 00:25:58,000
This one is difficult.

471
00:25:58,280 --> 00:25:59,360
Nont is my partner.

472
00:26:04,160 --> 00:26:05,320
Nont is...

473
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,160
I can't do it yet.

474
00:26:09,200 --> 00:26:10,280
Why?

475
00:26:10,480 --> 00:26:11,680
You don't want to say it?

476
00:26:11,840 --> 00:26:13,360
It's not that I don't want to say it.

477
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:15,560
But it's not true yet.

478
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,520
I haven't spoken to him

479
00:26:20,120 --> 00:26:21,720
ever since the day I made him sad.

480
00:26:27,240 --> 00:26:29,320
Then let's try changing the sentence.

481
00:26:29,960 --> 00:26:31,480
I want Nont to be my partner.

482
00:26:32,800 --> 00:26:34,200
I want Nont to be my partner.

483
00:26:34,760 --> 00:26:35,760
Again!

484
00:26:35,920 --> 00:26:37,640
I want Nont to be my partner!

485
00:26:38,200 --> 00:26:39,600
My heart is bursting for Nont right now.

486
00:26:43,600 --> 00:26:44,880
Don't tell anyone.

487
00:26:45,200 --> 00:26:46,240
Of course.

488
00:26:46,360 --> 00:26:48,520
This secret will die with my body.

489
00:26:48,600 --> 00:26:50,000
If you want to practice again,

490
00:26:50,040 --> 00:26:51,120
just let me know.

491
00:26:51,440 --> 00:26:52,440
One more time?

492
00:26:52,680 --> 00:26:54,480
Let's make it loud enough for Nont to hear!

493
00:26:59,120 --> 00:27:01,280
I want Nont to be my partner!

494
00:27:25,640 --> 00:27:27,720
Nont, I brought you chili sauce.

495
00:27:28,360 --> 00:27:29,520
You once said

496
00:27:29,640 --> 00:27:30,880
I'd never be able to find it.

497
00:27:37,800 --> 00:27:38,880
Nont,

498
00:27:38,960 --> 00:27:40,280
I can't think of anything.

499
00:27:41,960 --> 00:27:43,760
You want to buy me a birthday present?

500
00:27:43,880 --> 00:27:45,520
Is there anything special you want?

501
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,960
I want Koh Loy.

502
00:27:47,160 --> 00:27:48,080
Huh?

503
00:27:48,120 --> 00:27:49,640
you want me to buy you an island?

504
00:27:49,640 --> 00:27:50,760
Isn't that a bit much?

505
00:27:51,600 --> 00:27:52,560
"Koh Loy".

506
00:27:52,560 --> 00:27:53,960
It's a brand name of chili sauce.

507
00:27:55,040 --> 00:27:56,240
You probably won't be able

508
00:27:56,280 --> 00:27:57,320
to find it for me.

509
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,960
They've reduced production.

510
00:27:59,000 --> 00:28:00,000
It's almost impossible to

511
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:01,000
find in stores anymore.

512
00:28:01,040 --> 00:28:02,200
What's it called again?

513
00:28:02,240 --> 00:28:03,360
Koh Loy.

514
00:28:04,120 --> 00:28:05,160
Okay.

515
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:16,200
Thank you, Kit.

516
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:53,040
Cute.

517
00:29:05,280 --> 00:29:06,280
Hey Nont,

518
00:29:06,360 --> 00:29:07,840
why are you acting so suspicious?

519
00:29:07,840 --> 00:29:09,120
Are you secretly here to check on my boss?

520
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:11,000
You remember how Mr. Roch scheduled

521
00:29:11,040 --> 00:29:12,360
you and me to go close the deal

522
00:29:12,400 --> 00:29:13,360
with the spa client?

523
00:29:13,400 --> 00:29:14,400
Yeah.

524
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:15,560
He's scheduled the client

525
00:29:15,560 --> 00:29:16,880
- for this afternoon.
- This afternoon?

526
00:29:16,920 --> 00:29:17,800
Yes.

527
00:29:17,840 --> 00:29:19,680
Nont, but I'm working.

528
00:29:19,720 --> 00:29:20,920
How am I supposed to go?

529
00:29:21,400 --> 00:29:22,400
Just go tell him.

530
00:29:22,760 --> 00:29:24,240
But my boss is right there,

531
00:29:24,280 --> 00:29:25,320
how can I go?

532
00:29:25,960 --> 00:29:27,280
Mr. Roch has already followed up.

533
00:29:27,280 --> 00:29:28,240
We have to go now.

534
00:29:28,280 --> 00:29:29,320
What should I do?

535
00:29:29,560 --> 00:29:31,840
Should I lie and say I have allergies,

536
00:29:32,320 --> 00:29:34,160
that I'm sick and need to see a doctor?

537
00:29:34,600 --> 00:29:36,280
Or that I have a dentist appointment?

538
00:29:36,320 --> 00:29:38,440
Or should I just tell the truth?

539
00:29:39,040 --> 00:29:40,480
Look, listen to me.

540
00:29:40,600 --> 00:29:42,400
However you're going to tell him,

541
00:29:42,400 --> 00:29:43,480
that's your problem.

542
00:29:49,120 --> 00:29:50,000
Boss.

543
00:29:50,360 --> 00:29:52,080
I have something to consult you about.

544
00:29:52,120 --> 00:29:53,160
What is it?

545
00:29:53,200 --> 00:29:54,720
Today I'd like to go meet

546
00:29:54,760 --> 00:29:56,240
a client with Mr. Roch and Nont.

547
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,560
That team asked me to

548
00:29:57,560 --> 00:29:58,720
come help close the deal.

549
00:29:58,720 --> 00:29:59,720
Which client?

550
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:01,960
A spa and wellness business

551
00:30:02,120 --> 00:30:03,520
that's going public.

552
00:30:04,160 --> 00:30:05,240
Why do they need you

553
00:30:05,280 --> 00:30:06,400
to help close the deal?

554
00:30:06,440 --> 00:30:08,720
Mr. Roch said Nont and I

555
00:30:08,720 --> 00:30:11,400
have enough potential to do it.

556
00:30:11,880 --> 00:30:13,360
But you're my assistant.

557
00:30:13,520 --> 00:30:14,600
Yes.

558
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:16,400
But if the deal gets closed,

559
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:19,600
it's good for the company.

560
00:30:22,360 --> 00:30:23,440
Alright, I'll let you go.

561
00:30:26,240 --> 00:30:27,280
And let them know

562
00:30:27,320 --> 00:30:28,480
I'll be coming along too.

563
00:30:28,680 --> 00:30:29,680
Yes, sir.

564
00:30:54,200 --> 00:30:56,280
I'm so glad everyone could come.

565
00:30:56,360 --> 00:30:57,840
We'll be closing our business deal

566
00:30:57,880 --> 00:30:59,080
right here at the hot spring.

567
00:30:59,480 --> 00:31:00,360
Wonderful.

568
00:31:01,120 --> 00:31:02,400
This is Kit, my partner.

569
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,920
Mr. Sharp, his secretary.

570
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,400
And Mr. Nont, you've already met.

571
00:31:05,440 --> 00:31:07,280
Great, the more the merrier.

572
00:31:07,680 --> 00:31:09,160
I've heard about this spa's reputation

573
00:31:09,200 --> 00:31:10,040
for a long time.

574
